     "title": "A divider: 2.9 V",
     "text": "5 V × 3 kΩ / (3 kΩ + 2.2 kΩ) = <b>2.88 V</b> on a released wire, 58 % of the servo supply."
    },
    {
     "from": 17.490000000000002,
     "to": 30.46,
     "anchor": [
