    {
     "at": 11.48,
     "text": "On a Hitec D485HW, every read passed with the sample 40 to 213 nanoseconds after the release. At 267 nanoseconds, none did."
    },
    {
     "at": 21.49,
     "text": "The simulation places the edge in the same spot: the released wire crosses the input threshold 234 nanoseconds after the release."
